80;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Cancele a assinatura</a>.</p><p style="font-size:11px;line-height:24px;color:#9ca3af;margin:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">Ou envie um email para<!-- --> <a href="mailto:unsubscribe@app.example.com" style="color:#9ca3af;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">unsubscribe@app.example.com</a>.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"`;

